6,58.84723014285012 636.5,58.39524341381764 637,57.94541714243988 637.5,57.49779631096912 638,57.05242568111549 638.5,56.60934978957083 639,56.16861294355506 639.5,55.73025921638553 640,55.29433244306955 640.5,54.860876215921365 641,54.429933880202384 641.5,54.001548529787065 642,53.57576300285346 642.5,53.15261987759945 643,52.73216146798494 643.5,52.3144298195005 644,51.89946670496281 644.5,51.487313620337666 645,51.07801178058999 645.5,50.67160211556268 646,50.26812526588357 646.5,49.867621578901385 647,49.470131104651074 647.5,49.07569359184883 648,48.68434848391718 648.5,48.296134915040895 649,47.911091706253316 649.5,47.52925736155444 650,47.15067006406055\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4169e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polyline><line x1=\"64.38055098076552\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"64.38055098076552\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"48.38055098076552\" y=\"90\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"142.92036732051034\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"142.92036732051034\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"126.92036732051034\" y=\"90\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow></mrow></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"221.46018366025515\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"221.46018366025515\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"205.46018366025515\" y=\"90\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"378.53981633974485\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"378.53981633974485\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"369.53981633974485\" y=\"90\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"457.0796326794897\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"457.0796326794897\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"451.0796326794897\" y=\"90\" width=\"12\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"535.6194490192345\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"535.6194490192345\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"526.6194490192345\" y=\"90\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"614.1592653589794\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"614.1592653589794\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"602.1592653589794\" y=\"90\" width=\"24\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow></mrow></math></div></foreignObject></svg><figcaption>The graph of the cosine function in red and the sine function in blue.</figcaption></figure>","hidden":true,"type":"code"},{"input":"The following formulas enable us to determine the cosine and sine of a sum or difference of two angles in terms of the cosines and sines of those angles.\n\n!!! theorem\n\tLet ``s,t\\in\\mathbb{R}``.\n\t```math\n\t\\begin{aligned}\n\t\\cos\\left(s+t\\right)&=\\cos s\\,\\cos t-\\sin s\\,\\sin t\\\\\n\t\\sin\\left(s+t\\right)&=\\sin s\\,\\cos t+\\cos s\\,\\sin t\\\\\n\t\\cos\\left(s-t\\right)&=\\cos s\\,\\cos t+\\sin s\\,\\sin t\\\\\n\t\\sin\\left(s-t\\right)&=\\sin s\\,\\cos t-\\cos s\\,\\sin t\\\\\n\t\\end{aligned}\n\t```\n\n!!! proof\n\tLet ``s,t\\in\\mathbb{R}`` and consider the points\n\t```math\n\t\\begin{alignedat}{3}\n\tP_t&=\\left(\\cos t,\\sin t\\right)\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ &P_{s-t}&=\\left(\\cos\\left(s-t\\right),\\sin\\left(s-t\\right)\\right)\\\\\n\tP_s&=\\left(\\cos s,\\sin s\\right)\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ &A&=\\left(1,0\\right)\\,.\n\t\\end{alignedat}\n\t```\n\tThe angle ``\\angle P_tOP_s=s-t=\\angle AOP_{s-t}``, so the distance ``P_sP_t`` is equal to the distance ``P_{s-t}A``. \n\n\tTherefore, ``\\left(P_sP_t\\right)^2=\\left(P_{s-t}A\\right)^2``:\n\t```math\n\t\\left(\\cos s-\\cos t\\right)^2+\\left(\\sin s-\\sin t\\right)^2=\\left(\\cos\\left(s-t\\right)-1\\right)^2+\\sin^2\\left(s-t\\right)\\,,\n\t```\n\t```math\n\t\\begin{split}\n\t\\cos^2s- 2\\cos s\\,\\cos t+\\cos^2t+\\sin^2s-2\\sin s\\,\\sin t+\\sin^2 t\\\\\n\t=\\cos^2\\left(s-t\\right)-2\\cos\\left(s-t\\right)+1+\\sin^2\\left(s-t\\right)\\,.\n\t\\end{split}\n\t```\n\tSince ``\\cos^2x+\\sin^2x=1``, this reduces to ``\\cos\\left(s-t\\right)=\\cos s\\,\\cos t+\\sin s\\,\\sin t``.\n\n!!! exercise\n\tProve the other formulas using the even/odd behavior of the cosine and sine functions and the complementary angles relations.\n\nFrom the addition formulas, we obtain as special cases certain useful formulas called *double-angle formulas*.\n\n!!! corollary\n\tLet ``t\\in\\mathbb{R}``.\n\t1. ``\\sin 2t=2\\sin t\\,\\cos t`` and\n\t2. ``\\cos 2t=\\cos^2t-\\sin^2t=2\\cos^2t-1=1-2\\sin^2t``.\n\nSolving the last two formulas for ``\\cos^2t`` and ``\\sin^2t``, we obtain\n```math\n\\cos^2t=\\frac{1+\\cos2t}{2}\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\textrm{and}\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\sin^2t=\\frac{1-\\cos2t}{2}\\,,\n```\nwhich are sometimes calles the *half-angle formulas*.\n\nThere are four other trigonometric functions, each defined in terms of cosine and sine.\n\n!!! definition\n\t```math\n\t\\tan:\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\left\\{\\frac{\\mathrm{π}}{2}+k\\mathrm{π}\\mid k\\in \\mathbb{Z}\\right\\}\\to \\mathbb{R}:x\\mapsto\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}\\quad\\textrm{(tangent)}\n\t```\n\t```math\n\t\\cot:\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\left\\{k\\mathrm{π}\\mid k\\in \\mathbb{Z}\\right\\}\\to \\mathbb{R}:x\\mapsto\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\quad\\textrm{(cotangent)}\n\t```\n\t```math\n\t\\sec:\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\left\\{\\frac{\\mathrm{π}}{2}+k\\mathrm{π}\\mid k\\in \\mathbb{Z}\\right\\}\\to \\mathbb{R}:x\\mapsto\\frac{1}{\\cos x}\\quad\\textrm{(secans)}\n\t```\n\t```math\n\t\\csc:\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\left\\{k\\mathrm{π}\\mid k\\in \\mathbb{Z}\\right\\}\\to \\mathbb{R}:x\\mapsto\\frac{1}{\\sin x}\\quad\\textrm{(cosecans)}\n\t```","output":"","result":"The following formulas enable us to determine the cosine and sine of a sum or difference of two angles in terms of the cosines and sines of those angles.\nTheoremLet s,t∈ℝ.\ncos⁡(s+t)=cos⁡scos⁡t−sin⁡ssin⁡tsin⁡(s+t)=sin⁡scos⁡t+cos⁡ssin⁡tcos⁡(s−t)=cos⁡scos⁡t+sin⁡ssin⁡tsin⁡(s−t)=sin⁡scos⁡t−cos⁡ssin⁡t\nProofLet s,t∈ℝ and consider the points\nPt=(cos⁡t,sin⁡t)     Ps−t=(cos⁡(s−t),sin⁡(s−t))Ps=(cos⁡s,sin⁡s)     A=(1,0).\nThe angle ∠PtOPs=s−t=∠AOPs−t, so the distance PsPt is equal to the distance Ps−tA. \nTherefore, (PsPt)2=(Ps−tA)2:\n(cos⁡s−cos⁡t)2+(sin⁡s−sin⁡t)2=(cos⁡(s−t)−1)2+sin2⁡(s−t),\ncos2⁡s−2cos⁡scos⁡t+cos2⁡t+sin2⁡s−2sin⁡ssin⁡t+sin2⁡t=cos2⁡(s−t)−2cos⁡(s−t)+1+sin2⁡(s−t).\nSince cos2⁡x+sin2⁡x=1, this reduces to cos⁡(s−t)=cos⁡scos⁡t+sin⁡ssin⁡t.\nExerciseProve the other formulas using the even/odd behavior of the cosine and sine functions and the complementary angles relations.\nFrom the addition formulas, we obtain as special cases certain useful formulas called double-angle formulas.\nCorollaryLet t∈ℝ.\n\nsin⁡2t=2sin⁡tcos⁡t and\n\ncos⁡2t=cos2⁡t−sin2⁡t=2cos2⁡t−1=1−2sin2⁡t.\n\n\nSolving the last two formulas for cos2⁡t and sin2⁡t, we obtain\ncos2⁡t=1+cos⁡2t2     and     sin2⁡t=1−cos⁡2t2,\nwhich are sometimes calles the half-angle formulas.\nThere are four other trigonometric functions, each defined in terms of cosine and sine.\nDefinitiontan⁡:ℝ∖{π2+kπ|k∈ℤ}→ℝ:x↦sin⁡xcos⁡x(tangent)\ncot⁡:ℝ∖{kπ|k∈ℤ}→ℝ:x↦cos⁡xsin⁡x(cotangent)\nsec⁡:ℝ∖{π2+kπ|k∈ℤ}→ℝ:x↦1cos⁡x(secans)\ncsc⁡:ℝ∖{kπ|k∈ℤ}→ℝ:x↦1sin⁡x(cosecans)","resultHTML":"<p>The following formulas enable us to determine the cosine and sine of a sum or difference of two angles in terms of the cosines and sines of those angles.</p>\n<aside class=\"markdown-admonition markdown-admonition-theorem\"><div class=\"markdown-admonition-title\">Theorem</div><div class=\"markdown-admonition-body\"><p>Let <math><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></math>.</p>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" class=\"tml-jot\"><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></div></aside>\n<aside class=\"markdown-admonition markdown-admonition-proof\"><div class=\"markdown-admonition-title\">Proof</div><div class=\"markdown-admonition-body\"><p>Let <math><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></math> and consider the points</p>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" class=\"tml-jot\"><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mi>A</mi></mtd><mtd class=\"tml-left\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1,0</mn><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>.</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>\n<p>The angle <math><mrow><mi>∠</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>∠</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></math>, so the distance <math><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></math> is equal to the distance <math><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow></math>. </p>\n<p>Therefore, <math><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>A</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>:</p>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" class=\"tml-jot\"><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"tml-right\" style=\"padding-left:0em;padding-right:0em;\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>.</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>\n<p>Since <math><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>, this reduces to <math><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></math>.</p></div></aside>\n<aside class=\"markdown-admonition markdown-admonition-exercise\"><div class=\"markdown-admonition-title\">Exercise</div><div class=\"markdown-admonition-body\"><p>Prove the other formulas using the even/odd behavior of the cosine and sine functions and the complementary angles relations.</p></div></aside>\n<p>From the addition formulas, we obtain as special cases certain useful formulas called <em>double-angle formulas</em>.</p>\n<aside class=\"markdown-admonition markdown-admonition-corollary\"><div class=\"markdown-admonition-title\">Corollary</div><div class=\"markdown-admonition-body\"><p>Let <math><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></math>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><math><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></math> and\n</li>\n<li><math><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi></mrow></math>.\n</li>\n</ol></div></aside>\n<p>Solving the last two formulas for <math><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi></mrow></math>, we obtain</p>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>and</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>\n<p>which are sometimes calles the <em>half-angle formulas</em>.</p>\n<p>There are four other trigonometric functions, each defined in terms of cosine and sine.</p>\n<aside class=\"markdown-admonition markdown-admonition-definition\"><div class=\"markdown-admonition-title\">Definition</div><div class=\"markdown-admonition-body\"><math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">{</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>↦</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mtext>(tangent)</mtext></mrow></math>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>↦</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mtext>(cotangent)</mtext></mrow></math>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">{</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>↦</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mtext>(secans)</mtext></mrow></math>\n<math display=\"block\" class=\"tml-display\" style=\"display:block math;\"><mrow><mrow><mi>csc</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo lspace=\"0.2222em\" rspace=\"0.2222em\">:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>↦</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mtext>(cosecans)</mtext></mrow></math></div></aside>","hidden":true,"type":"markdown"},{"input":"const xmid = 240;\nconst ymid = 130;\nconst scale = 50;\n\nconst figure = JSCells.figure(\n  { width: 470, height: 255 },\n  \"The graph of the tangent function in red and the cotangent function in blue.\"\n);\n\nfigure.axes({\n  origin: [xmid, ymid],\n  scale,\n  x: { ticks: [] },\n  y: { ticks: [-2, -1, 1, 2] },\n});\n\nconst acot = (x) => Math.atan2(1, x);\n\nconst plotSegment = (fn, domain, stroke) => {\n  figure.plot(fn, {\n    domain,\n    samples: Math.ceil((domain[1] - domain[0]) / 0.01) + 1,\n    stroke,\n    width: 2,\n  });\n};\n\nconst addAsymptote = (x, stroke) => {\n  figure\n    .line()\n    .x1(x)\n    .y1(0)\n    .x2(x)\n    .y2(255)\n    .stroke(stroke)\n    .setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"2\");\n};\n\nconst addTick = (value) => {\n  const x = xmid + scale * value;\n\n  figure\n    .line()\n    .x1(x)\n    .y1(ymid - 4)\n    .x2(x)\n    .y2(ymid + 4)\n    .stroke(\"#000000\")\n    .strokeWidth(1);\n\n  return x;\n};\n\nconst xTicks = [\n  [String.raw`-\\uppi`, -Math.PI, 24],\n  [String.raw`-\\frac{\\uppi}{2}`, -Math.PI / 2, 30],\n  [String.raw`\\frac{\\uppi}{2}`, Math.PI / 2, 30],\n  [String.raw`\\uppi`, Math.PI, 18],\n];\n\nfor (const [label, value, labelWidth] of xTicks) {\n  const x = addTick(value);\n\n  figure.label(label, {\n    x: x - labelWidth / 2,\n    y: ymid + 10,\n    latex: true,\n    width: labelWidth,\n    height: 32,\n  });\n}\n\nconst tangentTop = Math.atan(130 / 50);\nconst tangentBottom = -Math.atan(125 / 50);\nconst tangent = (x) => Math.sin(x) / Math.cos(x);\n\nplotSegment(tangent, [tangentBottom - Math.PI, tangentTop - Math.PI], \"#b33a36\");\naddAsymptote(xmid - scale * Math.PI / 2, \"#b33a36\");\n\nplotSegment(tangent, [tangentBottom, tangentTop], \"#b33a36\");\naddAsymptote(xmid + scale * Math.PI / 2, \"#b33a36\");\n\nplotSegment(tangent, [tangentBottom + Math.PI, tangentTop + Math.PI], \"#b33a36\");\n\nconst cotangentTop = acot(130 / 50);\nconst cotangentBottom = acot(-125 / 50);\nconst cotangent = (x) => Math.cos(x) / Math.sin(x);\nconst blue = \"#4169e1\";\n\nplotSegment(cotangent, [-240 / 50, cotangentBottom - Math.PI], blue);\naddAsymptote(xmid - scale * Math.PI, blue);\n\nplotSegment(cotangent, [cotangentTop - Math.PI, cotangentBottom], blue);\nplotSegment(cotangent, [cotangentTop, cotangentBottom + Math.PI], blue);\n\naddAsymptote(xmid + scale * Math.PI, blue);\n\nplotSegment(cotangent, [cotangentTop + Math.PI, 230 / 50], blue);\n\nfigure;","output":"","result":"xy−2−112−π−π2π2πThe graph of the tangent function in red and the cotangent function in blue.","resultHTML":"<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"470\" height=\"255\" viewBox=\"0 0 470 255\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#000000\"></line><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#000000\"></line><polygon points=\"470,130 463,126 463,134\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\"></polygon><polygon points=\"240,0 236,7 244,7\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\"></polygon><foreignObject x=\"456\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"28\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mi>x</mi></math></div></foreignObject><foreignObject x=\"248\" y=\"-2\" width=\"14\" height=\"28\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mi>y</mi></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#000000\"></line><foreignObject x=\"216\" y=\"218\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#000000\"></line><foreignObject x=\"216\" y=\"168\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#000000\"></line><foreignObject x=\"216\" y=\"68\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mn>1</mn></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#000000\"></line><foreignObject x=\"216\" y=\"18\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mn>2</mn></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"82.92036732051034\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"82.92036732051034\" y2=\"134\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><foreignObject x=\"70.92036732051034\" y=\"140\" width=\"24\" height=\"32\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mspace></mspace></mrow></mrow></math></div></foreignObject><line x1=\"161.460183